# NAME: Instagram · Kiki Stable
# AUTHOR: kiki
# UPDATED: 2026-11-12
# FORMAT: Loon remote rule list; select policy when subscribing.
# GOAL: Instagram API, images, Reels, Stories and DM routing.
# SOURCES: Moli-X, Repcz, v2fly, MetaCubeX (2026-11-12), poohyeban.
# IMPORTANT: fbcdn / fbsbx are shared with Facebook; use the SAME stable policy for
# Instagram.list and Facebook.list. Domain rules cannot distinguish which app
# requested a shared CDN host. Read Instagram.README.md before assigning policies.
# No ad blocking, HTTPS interception, fixed IP ranges or blanket Meta ASN rules.

# Instagram web/app/API: www, i, graph, b-graph, api and variants.
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,instagram.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,cdninstagram.com

# Instagram image / Reels / Story / video delivery and service endpoints.
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,igcdn.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,igsonar.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,igtv.com

# Instagram share links and related official domains.
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,instagr.am
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,ig.me
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,oninstagram.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,instagram-brand.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,instagrampartners.com

# Shared Meta media CDN used by both Instagram and Facebook.
# If the Facebook subscription matches these first, its policy will handle them.
# Set both rule subscriptions to the same stable policy for predictable behavior.
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,fbcdn.net
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,fbcdn.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,fbsbx.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,fbsbx.net
DOMAIN,fbcdn-a.akamaihd.net

# Meta's shared delivery/edge infrastructure.
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,tfbnw.net

# Not included: blanket facebook.com, whatsapp.com, threads.net, meta.com,
# DOMAIN-KEYWORD,instagram, PROCESS-NAME, IP-ASN, old fixed IP-CIDR.
# Shared Facebook API / Meta login endpoints remain covered by Facebook.list.
